function selectRightTab(name){for(const id of ['systems','preview','activity']){$(`${id}Tab`).hidden=id!==name;$(`${id}TabBtn`).setAttribute('aria-selected',String(id===name))}if(name==='preview')refreshPreviewPane()}
$('systemsTabBtn').onclick=()=>selectRightTab('systems');$('previewTabBtn').onclick=()=>selectRightTab('preview');$('activityTabBtn').onclick=()=>selectRightTab('activity');
function activity(message,stateName='info'){const feed=$('activityFeed');const row=document.createElement('div');row.className=`activity-item ${stateName}`;row.textContent=`${new Date().toLocaleTimeString()} · ${message}`;feed.prepend(row);while(feed.children.length>30)feed.lastElementChild.remove()}
if(window.masterChief.onChatEvent)window.masterChief.onChatEvent(event=>{if(event.event==='repair'){activity(event.message||'Automatic recovery started','warning');selectRightTab('activity')}});
if(window.masterChief.onSchedulerEvent)window.masterChief.onSchedulerEvent(event=>{if(event.type==='delivered'){activity(`Reminder: ${event.job.title}`,'success');if($('workspaceSectionTitle').textContent==='Scheduled')renderScheduledJobs()}});
if(window.masterChief.onMonitorEvent)window.masterChief.onMonitorEvent(event=>{if(event.type==='changed'){activity(`${event.monitor.title}: ${event.monitor.lastLabel}`,event.monitor.lastState==='ready'?'success':'warning');if($('workspaceSectionTitle').textContent==='Scheduled')renderScheduledJobs()}});
async function savePreviewToProject(artifact){const projects=(await window.masterChief.listProjects()).projects;let name=projects[0]?.name||'';if(!name){name=prompt('Create a project to protect this output');if(!name)return;await window.masterChief.createProject(name)}else{name=prompt(`Save to project`,name)||'';if(!name)return}await window.masterChief.saveArtifactToProject({project:name,artifact});activity(`${artifact.split('/').pop()} saved to ${name}`,'success');await refreshProjects()}
async function refreshPreviewPane(){const pane=$('previewPane');try{const items=await window.masterChief.listGeneratedMedia(30);pane.replaceChildren(...items.map(item=>{const card=document.createElement('article');card.className='preview-item';const title=document.createElement('strong');title.textContent=item.filename;const ext=(item.filename.split('.').pop()||'').toLowerCase(),tag=['mp4','m4v','mov','webm','ogv'].includes(ext)?'video':['mp3','wav','m4a','aac','ogg','flac'].includes(ext)?'audio':'img';const preview=document.createElement(tag);if(tag!=='img')preview.controls=true;window.masterChief.previewArtifact(item.path).then(data=>{if(data.previewable)preview.src=data.dataUrl}).catch(()=>{});const actions=document.createElement('div');actions.className='preview-actions';for(const [label,fn] of [['Open',()=>window.masterChief.openArtifact(item.path)],['Reveal',()=>window.masterChief.revealArtifact(item.path)],['Save As…',()=>window.masterChief.saveArtifactAs(item.path)],['Save to Project',()=>savePreviewToProject(item.path)]]){const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=label;b.onclick=fn;actions.append(b)}card.append(title,preview,actions);return card}));if(!items.length)pane.innerHTML='<p class="hint">No generated media is waiting for review.</p>'}catch(e){pane.textContent=`Preview unavailable: ${e.message}`}}

